# "Damage equal to that creature's power" is read as Terror of the Peaks' ability resolves, or, once the creature has left the
# battlefield, as it last existed there (CR 608.2h). On turn 5 Bot1's Embereth Shieldbreaker (2/1) enters and the ability
# goes on the stack aimed at Bot2. In response Bot1 casts Full Bore on it (+3/+2, a 5/3), and Bot2 answers with Lightning
# Bolt, which kills it. The ability then deals 5 damage to Bot2: neither the power when it triggered (2) nor nothing.

